---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";

const title = "Concrete Flatwork in Michigan | Faber Concrete";
const description =
  "Concrete flatwork in Michigan: five-inch slabs, six inches at the approach, compacted 21AA, and finishers with more than 25 years on the tools.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <Header />
  <main class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Flatwork</p>
      <h1>Flatwork, not a side hobby</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Concrete is its own company here. The flatwork gets the same spec as the driveways: a five-inch slab, six inches where it is an approach, and a compacted 21AA base. We do not pour four inches to win the bid.
      </p>
      <p>
        There are not as many crews who actually know how to do concrete, and a lot of the ones who do never advertise. That is the opening. Faber Concrete stays a specialist so the work does not look like a jack-of-all-trades add-on.
      </p>
      <h2>The finish</h2>
      <p>
        The finishers have been finishing for more than 25 years. Matt calls the finish process phenomenal, and it is part of the premium product — the thing you can see on day one, sitting on a base and a thickness you will not see until a cheap slab fails.
      </p>
      <h2>Same rules as a driveway</h2>
      <ul class="steps">
        <li>
          <strong>Never 4 inches</strong>
          Five inches every time. Six inches on an approach.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>21AA, compacted</strong>
          Graded and compacted before forming and pouring. Never over dirt. Never over compacted sand alone.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Priced down the middle</strong>
          Not the cheapest bid. Not outrageously more. A superior finish and a slab that is built for this climate.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn--tide" href="/estimate">Request an estimate</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/services/driveways">Driveways and approaches</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
